WEBVTT

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.370
"Mama yangu alinisukuma."

00:02:01.394 --> 00:02:02.608
(Vicheko)

00:02:02.632 --> 00:02:03.648
Tumikia!

00:02:04.427 --> 00:02:07.466
Sherwin Nuland anasema,
"Ilikuwa ni fursa kutumikia kama daktari."

00:02:08.093 --> 00:02:10.203
Watoto wengi wanataka kuwa mamilionea.

00:02:10.227 --> 00:02:11.477
Jambo la kwanza ninalosema ni:

00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:13.403
"Sawa, vizuri huwezi kujihudumia mwenyewe;

00:02:13.427 --> 00:02:15.664
unapaswa kutumikia wengine
kitu cha thamani.

00:02:15.688 --> 00:02:18.225
Kwa sababu hiyo ndiyo njia
watu hupata utajiri. "

00:02:19.074 --> 00:02:20.099
Mawazo!

00:02:20.123 --> 00:02:22.976
MwanaTED Bill Gates anasema, "Nilikuwa na wazo:

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.976
kuanzisha kampuni ya kwanza ya programu za mikro-kompyuta."

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.976
Ningependa kusema ni wazo zuri sana.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.976
Na hakuna miujiza katika ubunifu
wa mawazo mapya --